                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#2v">-2v</locus>بِسْمِ اللّهِ الرَّحْمنِ الرَّحِيمِ الْحَمْدُ للّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ الرَّحْمنِ الرَّحِيمِ مَلِكِ يَوْمِ الدِّين</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#381v">-381v</locus>[...]وَإِنَّهُ لِحُبِّ الْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِي الْقُبُو </explicit>
                     <note>Partially disrupted at the beginning and the end.  The words aren't divided into two different lines in the main text, but they are in some of the red titles for the suras that seem to have been later added.</note>
                     <note/>
